| PS1 (96) | Pipeline A (Bowtie2) | {{ps1_raw}} | {{ps1_pa_classified}} | {{ps1_pa_ontarget_pct}}% | {{ps1_pa_nonspec_pct}}% | **{{ps1_pa_dimer_pct}}%** | {{ps1_pub_dimer}}% dim. |
